    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "IE:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " a synergistic agent in combination regimens (eg, prosthetic valve). Gentamicin 3 mg/kg IV/IM once daily added to penicillin G shortens penicillin-susceptible streptococcal native-valve IE to 2 wk; enterococci (penicillin-allergic): vancomycin + gentamicin × 6 wk."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "All cause renal toxicity (often reversible), vestibular/auditory toxicity (often irreversible; vertigo, ataxia) and prolonged neuromuscular blockade (can worsen myasthenia gravis). Risk rises with high or frequent doses, high levels, >3 days, older age, renal disease, other nephrotoxins (eg, vancomycin, contrast); loop diuretics add ototoxicity."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Once-daily IV dosing preferred for most indications. Peak/trough levels after the 2nd–3rd dose or if therapy >3 days; serum creatinine every 2–3 days. Serial audiography if >2 weeks or at ototoxicity risk."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Allergy to aminoglycosides. Pregnancy:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " possible fetal risk (eg, auditory toxicity with streptomycin), but benefit may outweigh it."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
